          // slug in one act. So it is the publish surface that matters most,
          // and unlike every other key on this document it cannot simply be
          // frozen: admins and editors write it on every publish. It is
          // frozen for an `author` and open to the roles above (AGL-2334).
          //
          // Deliberately NOT added to the blanket `hasAny` list above: that
          // list is the Admin-SDK-only set, and `screens` has a legitimate
          // client writer. Two different questions, two conditions.
          (canPublishHostContent(hostId) ||
